[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990819033","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107689#issuecomment-2990819033","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107689","id":2990819033,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yREbZ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T10:24:26Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T10:26:22Z","body":"> Doesn't use MSAA 8X, it's very slow and may be unsupported on low-end. Thumbnail is small and its quality is not critical.\r\n\r\nDid you benchmark this (if so, on which GPU)? Considering how small thumbnails are, I doubt the thumbnail generation is GPU-bottlenecked. If it really is, I would switch to 4x MSAA instead (which looks close to 8x MSAA but is much cheaper, and basically supported everywhere too).\r\n\r\nIn any case, Godot already falls back to 4x MSAA if 8x MSAA is not supported (which is the case on all mobile GPUs including Apple Silicon).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2990819033/reactions","tota